. The hundreds place: 1 (from 921126) + 6 (from 866649) = 7. Write down 7.\n4. The thousands place: 1 (from 921126) + 6 (from 866649) = 7. Write down 7.\n5. The ten-thousands place: 2 (from 921126) + 6 (from 866649) = 8. Write down 8.\n6. The hundred-thousands place: 9 (from 921126) + 8 (from 866649) = 17. Write down 7 and carry over 1.\n7. The millions place: 1 (carry over). Write down 1.\n\nPutting all the digits together, we get 1,787,775.\n\nAnswer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\boxed{1787775}.", '']
