r is 564,732. I must have miscalculated when I thought I got 563,732 earlier. So the correct answer is 564,732.\n\nAlright, so the initial correct reasoning gives 564,732. The mistake in the second method was a miscalculation when I thought 21,686 +43,046 was 63,732 instead of 64,732. But corrected now. So the final answer is correct.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe final computed sum is \\boxed{564732}.",
