nd) =8  \n\nSo combining all digits: 8 (hundred thousands), 9 (ten thousands), 3 (thousands), 0 (hundreds), 1 (tens), 9 (ones). Total: 893,019.  \n\nWait, that matches the first answer. But let me verify with another method:\n\n285,563 + 607,456 = ?\n\nBreakdown:  \n285,563 + 600,000 = 885,563  \n885,563 +7,456 = 893,019.  \n\nYes, correct. So the final answer is 893,019.  \n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe sum of 285,563 and 607,456 is **893,019**.  \n\n\\boxed{893019}", '']
